        "status": "accepted_selected_clip",
        "notes": "Reviewed all124 chronological source phases plus enlarged boot contacts and both hand grips. Selected two successive steps: forward supporting boot loads and travels back while the other boot passes with a raised knee, extends and plants; support then transfers and the other boot passes/lands. Frames0/50 return to the same forward-support/rear-swing phase. Cannon remains on the supporting right shoulder, separate baton clears the legs, coat follows the step. Fixed body scale/anchor. No continuous playback claim. Selected intervals inspected in offscreen Godot at128px battle size; no continuous playback claim."
